{"type": "mcq", "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"r left parenthesis t right parenthesis equals 63 t minus 2 t squared\"><mi>r</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>63</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The function <math alttext=\"r\"><mi>r</mi>\n</math> is defined by the given equation. The function <math alttext=\"s\"><mi>s</mi>\n</math> is defined by <math alttext=\"s left parenthesis t right parenthesis equals r left parenthesis t right parenthesis plus 1\"><mi>s</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math>. Which expression represents the maximum value of <math alttext=\"s left parenthesis t right parenthesis\"><mi>s</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced></math>?</p>", "keys": ["ee207101-6e70-46cd-aaf0-5328307f4312"], "answerOptions": [{"id": "269a277e-79b7-42be-b3e6-6464426b4a7f", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"1 plus left parenthesis StartFraction 63 Over 2 EndFraction right parenthesis squared\"><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>63</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p>"}, {"id": "ee207101-6e70-46cd-aaf0-5328307f4312", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"1 plus 2 left parenthesis StartFraction 63 Over 4 EndFraction right parenthesis squared\"><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>63</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p>"}, {"id": "79c0ef1a-2f6a-4444-ba1d-7f4c1f73fb68", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"1 minus 2 left parenthesis StartFraction 63 Over 4 EndFraction right parenthesis squared\"><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>63</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p>"}, {"id": "d4fdd057-dd0f-49b3-bfd1-5eacde816e77", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"1 minus left parenthesis StartFraction 63 Over 2 EndFraction right parenthesis squared\"><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>63</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p>"}], "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is correct. It's given that <math alttext=\"s left parenthesis t right parenthesis equals r left parenthesis t right parenthesis plus 1\"><mi>s</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math>. Since <math alttext=\"r left parenthesis t right parenthesis equals 63 t minus 2 t squared\"><mi>r</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>63</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>, it follows that <math alttext=\"s left parenthesis t right parenthesis equals 63 t minus 2 t squared plus 1\"><mi>s</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>63</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, or <math alttext=\"s left parenthesis t right parenthesis equals minus 2 t squared plus 63 t plus 1\"><mi>s</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>63</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math>. For a quadratic function <math alttext=\"s\"><mi>s</mi>\n</math> defined by an equation of the form <math alttext=\"s left parenthesis t right parenthesis equals a left parenthesis t minus h right parenthesis squared plus k\"><mi>s</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></math>, where <math alttext=\"a\"><mi>a</mi>\n</math>, <math alttext=\"h\"><mi>h</mi>\n</math>, and <math alttext=\"k\"><mi>k</mi>\n</math> are constants and <math alttext=\"a\"><mi>a</mi>\n</math> is negative, the value of&nbsp;<math alttext=\"s left parenthesis t right parenthesis\"><mi>s</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>)</mo></math> reaches its maximum, <math alttext=\"k\"><mi>k</mi>\n</math>, when the value of <math alttext=\"t\"><mi>t</mi>\n</math> is <math alttext=\"h\"><mi>h</mi>\n</math>. The equation <math alttext=\"s left parenthesis t right parenthesis equals minus 2 t squared plus 63 t plus 1\"><mi>s</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>63</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math> can be rewritten in the form&nbsp;<math alttext=\"s left parenthesis t right parenthesis equals a left parenthesis t minus h right parenthesis squared plus k\"><mi>s</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></math> by completing the square. The equation <math alttext=\"s left parenthesis t right parenthesis equals minus 2 t squared plus 63 t plus 1\"><mi>s</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>63</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math> is equivalent to <math alttext=\"s left parenthesis t right parenthesis equals minus 2 left parenthesis t squared minus StartFraction 63 Over 2 EndFraction t right parenthesis plus 1\"><mi>s</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>63</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, or <math alttext=\"s left parenthesis t right parenthesis equals minus 2 left parenthesis t squared minus StartFraction 63 Over 2 EndFraction t plus left parenthesis StartFraction 63 Over 4 EndFraction right parenthesis squared minus left parenthesis StartFraction 63 Over 4 EndFraction right parenthesis squared right parenthesis plus 1\"><mi>s</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>63</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>63</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>63</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math>. This equation can be rewritten as <math alttext=\"s left parenthesis t right parenthesis equals minus 2 left parenthesis left parenthesis t minus StartFraction 63 Over 4 EndFraction right parenthesis squared minus left parenthesis StartFraction 63 Over 4 EndFraction right parenthesis squared right parenthesis plus 1\"><mi>s</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>63</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>63</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, or <math alttext=\"s left parenthesis t right parenthesis equals minus 2 left parenthesis t minus StartFraction 63 Over 4 EndFraction right parenthesis squared plus 1 plus 2 left parenthesis StartFraction 63 Over 4 EndFraction right parenthesis squared\"><mi>s</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>63</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>63</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math>. This equation is in the form <math alttext=\"s left parenthesis t right parenthesis equals a left parenthesis t minus h right parenthesis squared plus k\"><mi>s</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></math>, where <math alttext=\"a equals negative 2\"><mrow>\n<mi>a</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mrow>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mn>2</mn>\n</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math>, <math alttext=\"h equals StartFraction 63 Over 4 EndFraction\"><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>63</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>, and <math alttext=\"k equals 1 plus 2 left parenthesis StartFraction 63 Over 4 EndFraction right parenthesis squared\"><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>63</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math>. Therefore, the maximum value of <math alttext=\"s left parenthesis t right parenthesis\"><mi>s</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is <math alttext=\"1 plus 2 left parenthesis StartFraction 63 Over 4 EndFraction right parenthesis squared\"><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>63</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>", "externalid": "ee6062be-ade1-48a3-b556-2cca3b7b45e3", "correct_answer": ["B"]}